  ['Birth','Soul crosses from spirit world into living world; body (ahụ) received from Ala; ndụ (life force) activated; naming ceremony on 4th night confirms commitment to living world','Ọwa — the crossing; naming (ịgụ aha)'],
  ['Life','Onwe acts within the field set by chi; ọgụ (moral integrity) maintained or violated; community relationships built; ọfọ (ancestral authority) potentially inherited','Chi / onwe dialogue; ọgụ na ọfọ'],
